gin-top: 6px;font-weight: 600}\n.plan-features {list-style: none;display: grid;grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;gap: 12px 18px}\n.plan-features li {font-size: 14px;color: #222233;display: flex;align-items: center;gap: 8px}\n.plan-features li::before {content: \"+\";font-weight: 900;color: #7828c8}\n.plan-action {text-align: right}\n.plan-btn {display: inline-block;width: 100%;text-align: center;text-decoration: none;background-color: #ffffff;color: #1a1a24;border: 2px solid #1a1a24;padding: 14px 20px;font-size: 14px;font-weight: 800;box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #1a1a24;transition: all 0.15s ease}\n.plan-btn:hover {background-color: #7828c8;color: #ffffff;transform: translate(-2px, -2px);box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #1a1a24}\n.plan-btn.primary {background-color: #7828c8;color: #ffffff}\n.plan-btn.primary:hover {background-color: #1a1a24;color: #ffffff}\n.setup-guide-wrapper {margin-bottom: 80px}\n.guide-steps {display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);gap: 20px;margin-bottom: 28px}\n.step-card {background-color: #ffffff;border: 3px solid #1a1a24;box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1a1a24;padding: 24px}\n.step-number {font-size: 14px;font-weight: 900;background-color: #1a1a24;color: #ffffff;display: inline-block;padding: 2px 10px;margin-bottom: 14px}\n.step-card h4 {font-size: 18px;font-weight: 800;margin-bottom: 10px}\n.step-card p {font-size: 14px;color: #444455;line-height: 1.6}\n.clients-panel {background-color: #ffffff;border: 3px solid #1a1a24;box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1a1a24;padding: 28px}\n.clients-grid {display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);gap: 16px;margin-top: 18px}\n.client-box {border: 2px solid #1a1a24;padding: 16px;background-color: #fbfbfd}\n.client-box h5 {font-size: 16px;font-weight: 800;margin-bottom: 6px}\n.client-box p {font-size: 13px;color: #555566;margin-bottom: 12px}\n.client-link {font-size: 12px;font-weight: 800;color: #7828c8;text-decoration: none;display: inline-block;border-bottom: 1px dashed #7828c8}\n.faq-wrapper {margin-bottom: 80px}\n.faq-list {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 16px}\n.faq-item {background-color: #ffffff;border: 3px solid #1a1a24;box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #1a1a24}\n.faq-summary {padding: 18px 22px;font-size: 16px;font-weight: 800;cursor: pointer;outline: none;user-select: none;position: relative;list-style: none}\n.faq-summary::-webkit-details-marker {display: none}\n.faq-summary::after {content: \"+\";position: absolute;right: 22px;top: 50%;transform: translateY(-50%);font-size: 20px;font-weight: 900;color: #7828c8}\ndetails[open] .faq-summary::after {content: \"–\"}\ndetails[open] .faq-summary {border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a24;background-color: #faf7ff}\n.faq-content {padding: 20px 22px;font-size: 14px;color: #444455;line-height: 1.7}\n.faq-content p + p {margin-top: 10px}\nfooter {border-top: 3px solid #1a1a24;padding: 36px 0 20px 0;font-size: 13px;color: #666677;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center}\n.footer-left {font-weight: 600}\n.footer-right {display: flex;gap: 20px}\n.footer-right a {color: #1a1a24;text-decoration: none;font-weight: 700}\n.footer-right a:hover {color: #7828c8}\n\n@media (max-width: 960px) {\n  .layout-frame {flex-direction: column}\n  .sidebar-nav {width: 100%;height: auto;position: relative;border-right: none;border-bottom: 3px solid #1a1a24;padding: 20px}\n  .nav-menu {flex-direction: row;flex-wrap: wrap;margin-top: 16px;gap: 8px}\n  .nav-link {padding: 8px 12px}\n  .nav-meta {display: none}\n  .content-area {padding: 28px 20px}\n  .dash-span-8,\n  .dash-span-4,\n  .dash-span-6 {grid-column: span 12}\n  .plan-item {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 20px}\n  .plan-action {text-align: left}\n  .guide-steps {grid-template-columns: 1fr}\n  .clients-grid {grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr}\n  footer {flex-direction: column;gap: 16px;align-items: flex-start}\n}\n</style><div class=\"layout-frame\">\n  <nav class=\"sidebar-nav\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"brand-mark\">\n        <span></span>Lambda\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"nav-menu\">\n        <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#status\">控制面板</a></li>\n        <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#plans\">服务套餐</a></li>\n        <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#guide\">配置指引</a></li>\n        <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#clients\">软件支持</a></li>\n        <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"nav-meta\">\n      <strong>日常运转监察</strong><br>\n      更新周期：实时规则维护<br>\n      状态：所有链路规格就绪\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main class=\"content-area\">\n    <section id=\"status\" class=\"hero-block\">\n      <div class=\"hero-header\">\n        <span class=\"tagline\">直观网络调度台</span>\n        <h1>Lambda 网络指引与连接面板</h1>\n        <p>嗨，朋友。欢迎来到 Lambda 的配置中心。这里没有浮夸的营销词藻，只有整理得明明白白的网络资源水位、分流规则状态以及踏踏实实的配置教程。无论你是日常查阅资料还是协作开发，我们先把手头的工具调试妥当。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-grid\">\n        <article class=\"dash-card dash-span-8\">\n          <div class=\"metric-title\">\n            <span>分流规则策略池</span>\n            <span class=\"metric-badge\">动态就绪</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"metric-val\">3,420 条规则</div>\n          <p class=\"metric-desc\">内置针对主流生产力平台、远程开发套件与基础媒体库的分流基准。按需自动切换路由，不干扰本地内网请求与常用服务访问。</p>\n          <div class=\"indicator-row\">\n            <div class=\"indicator-pill active\">智能分流（推荐）</div>\n            <div class=\"indicator-pill\">全局代理</div>\n            <div class=\"indicator-pill\">直连放行</div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"dash-card dash-span-4\">\n          <div class=\"metric-title\">\n            <span>基础节点群</span>\n            <span class=\"metric-badge\">实时轮询</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"metric-val\">100%</div>\n          <p class=\"metric-desc\">核心骨干中继接入点保持在线，定期剔除失效上行，提供安静可靠的背景连接保障。</p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"dash-card dash-span-6\">\n          <div class=\"metric-title\">\n            <span>配额使用基准</span>\n            <span class=\"metric-badge\">当月周期</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"metric-val\">100GB ~ 1TB</div>\n          <p class=\"metric-desc\">各档位流量均按自然月度标准独立划分，用量清晰，不搞隐藏扣费或突发限速的暗箱操作。</p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"dash-card dash-span-6\">\n          <div class=\"metric-title\">\n            <span>并发设备限额</span>\n            <span class=\"metric-badge\">硬件绑定松绑</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"metric-val\">3 至 20 台</div>\n          <p class=\"metric-desc\">支持手机、电脑、软路由同时连线。不限制单个设备品牌，满足你多屏幕协作与日常换机需求。</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"plans\" class=\"plans-wrapper\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">选择适合你节奏的套餐方案</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">挑选服务不需要做复杂的算术题。我们把基础版、旗舰版与团队版按单列大卡依次排开，每一项权益和价格都写在明处，按照你的日常用量安心选择即可。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"plan-stack\">\n        <article class=\"plan-item\">\n          <div class=\"plan-meta\">\n            <h3>基础版</h3>\n            <div class=\"plan-price-main\">¥15 <span>/ 月</span></div>\n            <div class=\"plan-price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</div>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n            <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"plan-action\">\n            <a class=\"plan-btn\" href=\"#\">选定此方案</a>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"plan-item highlight\">\n          <div class=\"badge-flag\">大家常选的标准配置</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-meta\">\n            <h3>旗舰版</h3>\n            <div class=\"plan-price-main\">¥35 <span>/ 月</span></div>\n            <div class=\"plan-price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</div>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n            <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n            <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"plan-action\">\n            <a class=\"plan-btn primary\" href=\"#\">获取旗舰版</a>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"plan-item\">\n          <div class=\"plan-meta\">\n            <h3>团队版</h3>\n            <div class=\"plan-price-main\">¥85 <span>/ 月</span></div>\n            <div class=\"plan-price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</div>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n            <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n            <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"plan-action\">\n            <a class=\"plan-btn\" href=\"#\">选定团队版</a>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"guide\" class=\"setup-guide-wrapper\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">三步快速连入网络</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">不用担心繁琐的技术名词。按下面的三步走，一般两到三分钟就能完成初始化设置：</p>\n\n      <div class=\"guide-steps\">\n        <div class=\"step-card\">\n          <span class=\"step-number\">第一步</span>\n          <h4>拷贝专属订阅</h4>\n          <p>在你的 Lambda 账户后台找到订阅链接，点击“一键复制”。链接内包含了你的加密认证凭据与节点路由配置，请保管好别外借。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-card\">\n          <span class=\"step-number\">第二步</span>\n          <h4>导入通用客户端</h4>\n          <p>打开你熟悉的任何主流规则路由软件，选择“从剪贴板导入”或“添加订阅 URL”，拉取最新的节点配置列表并保存。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-card\">\n          <span class=\"step-number\">第三步</span>\n          <h4>选择节点与分流</h4>\n          <p>在规则策略组中选中自动延迟测试，或者手动挑选近邻的接入节点。将模式设为“规则分流”即可开始顺畅浏览。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"clients\" class=\"clients-panel\">\n        <h3>跨平台客户端使用说明</h3>\n        <p>Lambda 支持公开通用的订阅格式协议，你可以根据手头的系统平台搭配日常信赖的核心内核工具，我们不强制捆绑专有客户端软件：</p>\n\n        <div class=\"clients-grid\">\n          <div class=\"client-box\">\n            <h5>Windows</h5>\n            <p>支持基于通用 Clash 内核或 Sing-box 架构的图形化工具，支持开机启动与系统代理解析。</p>\n            <a class=\"client-link\" href=\"#\">查看配置备忘</a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"client-box\">\n            <h5>macOS</h5>\n            <p>搭配常用开源项目，原生适配 Apple 芯片与 Intel 平台，提供低占用的后台守护分流服务。</p>\n            <a class=\"client-link\" href=\"#\">查看配置备忘</a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"client-box\">\n            <h5>iOS / iPadOS</h5>\n            <p>可配合应用商店内合规网络调试工具，扫码或粘贴链接即可一键拉取并自动保持定时同步。</p>\n            <a class=\"client-link\" href=\"#\">查看配置备忘</a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"client-box\">\n            <h5>Android</h5>\n            <p>支持各类开源移动客户端，分应用代理功能友好，移动数据与家庭 Wi-Fi 切换无感平滑。</p>\n            <a class=\"client-link\" href=\"#\">查看配置备忘</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"faq\" class=\"faq-wrapper\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">常见问题解答</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-intro\">遇到疑难困惑先别慌，这里整理了朋友们平时问得最多的几个小问题，点击即可展开查看：</p>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-list\">\n        <details class=\"faq-item\">\n          <summary class=\"faq-summary\">每月流量在什么时候重置？用超了会怎么样？</summary>\n          <div class=\"faq-content\">\n            <p>Lambda 的流量计数周期是按照你下单当天的日期为基准自然滚动的，并不是固定在每月一号一刀切。比如你是 12 号订阅的，下一次重置就会在次月 12 号。</p>\n            <p>如果不小心把当月流量额度用尽了，服务会自动暂停外网中继，但不会产生任何额外扣费。你可以等待下个周期重置，或者在面板里随时按原价差额重置流量包。</p>\n          </div>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"faq-item\">\n          <summary class=\"faq-summary\">“同时在线设备数”具体是怎么界定的？</summary>\n          <div class=\"faq-content\">\n            <p>这里的“同时在线”指的是同一瞬间与节点服务器维持着活跃传输通道的设备数量。如果你家里有五台设备，但平时只有手机和笔记本在工作，另外三台在待机休眠，基础版（支持 3 台）通常就完全够用了。</p>\n            <p>如果你将订阅配置在家庭软路由或透明网关上，整个内网通常在服务器端被识别为单台路由接入，不过为了保证体验，仍建议按照实际家庭用网规模选择匹配的套餐。</p>\n          </div>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"faq-item\">\n          <summary class=\"faq-summary\">节点连不上或者延迟忽然升高，该怎么排查？</summary>\n          <div class=\"faq-content\">\n            <p>别着急，你可以按这个简单顺序自我检查一下：首先在软件里手动点击“更新订阅”，确认本地的节点地址和密钥是最新的；其次检查本地系统的系统时钟是否精准同步（时钟相差超过 90 秒可能导致握手失败）；最后尝试切换到其他备用节点。如果依旧异常，请随时通过后台工单发消息给我们。</p>\n          </div>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"faq-item\">\n          <summary class=\"faq-summary\">订阅链接如果泄露了，该怎么处理？</summary>\n          <div class=\"faq-content\">\n            <p>订阅链接包含了个人的身份令牌，建议像密码一样妥善保管。如果不慎误发到公开群聊或代码仓库中，只需登录账户管理面板，找到订阅安全栏目，点击“重置订阅链接”按钮。旧链接将立刻失效，再把新生成的地址更新到你的设备客户端里即可。</p>\n          </div>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      <div class=\"footer-left\">\n        Lambda © 静态配置手册与服务指南 · 务实设计与客观说明\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"footer-right\">\n        <a href=\"#status\">回到顶部</a>\n        <a href=\"#plans\">查看方案</a>\n        <a href=\"#faq\">疑问解答</a>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</div>",
